# pipeline/reextract is CODE-ONLY.
#
# Every scan, extraction output, verdict, console, and data-bearing doc lives in the PRIVATE
# dr-voluminous repo (reextract_vol1/), NEVER here — this is a PUBLIC repo and dr-voluminous scans
# are private. Scripts read their data root from data_config.py (env REEXTRACT_DATA_ROOT).
#
# Config belongs in .yaml (e.g. book_profile*.yaml), never .json. To land a deliberately-scrubbed
# public doc, force-add it (`git add -f`) — the friction is intentional.
*.png
*.json
*.jsonl
*.html
*.md
